  "notes": "USAGE:\n{打破|だは} has a forceful nuance — it implies actively smashing through barriers rather than quietly overcoming them. It is commonly used in formal or written contexts, especially in news and speeches.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{記録|きろく}→記録：02490_kiroku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{打破|だは}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to break a record\n- ⟦{現状|げんじょう}→現状：02721_genjou⟧{打破|だは}: breaking through the status quo\n- ⟦{偏見|へんけん}→偏見：06025_henken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{打破|だは}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to smash prejudice\n- ⟦{慣習|かんしゅう}→慣習：05523_kanshuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{打破|だは}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to break old customs\n- ⟦{壁|かべ}→壁：01290_kabe⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{打破|だは}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to break through a barrier",
